text.section:
The notice of the election shall include with any other information required by law:

A summary of the cable television services that the governing body of the municipality proposes to provide to subscribers residing within the boundaries of the municipality;


The feasibility study summary under § 15.2-2108.6;


A statement that a full copy of the feasibility study is available for inspection and copying; and


The location in the municipality where the feasibility study may be inspected or copied.
